---
const topics = [
  {
    label: "AI Tools & APIs",
    icon: `<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>`
  },
  {
    label: "Web Development",
    icon: `<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>`
  },
  {
    label: "DevOps & Infrastructure",
    icon: `<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"></path></svg>`
  },
  {
    label: "Database Systems",
    icon: `<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5v14a9 3 0 0 0 18 0V5"></path><path d="M3 12a9 3 0 0 0 18 0"></path></svg>`
  }
];
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-8 border-t-2 border-brutal-black dark:border-brutal-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brutal-accent mb-6">About</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12">
          BuildAtScale
        </h2>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start mb-12">
          <!-- Avatar -->
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-[140px] h-[140px] border-2 border-brutal-black dark:border-brutal-white overflow-hidden bg-brutal-gray-dark">
            <img
              src="/images/avatar-small.png"
              alt="Ronnie - BuildAtScale"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-110 translate-x-[2px] translate-y-[8px]"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Text content -->
          <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-brutal-black/80 dark:text-brutal-white/80">
            <p>
              Lately I'm exploring how to stop writing every line of code myself and start directing
              AI agents to handle development, research, and deployment.
            </p>
            <p>
              Follow along if you're interested in building with AI tools, web development from front
              to back, DevOps and infrastructure workflows, and the awkward transition from coding
              to orchestrating AI systems.
            </p>
            <p>
              Hi, my name is Ronnie. I've been building web and software systems for about two decades.
              If there's one thing I've learned it's that the learning never stops. Join me in exploring
              the next wave and beyond.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="topics" class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brutal-accent mb-6">
          What You'll Find Here
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-12">
          {topics.map((topic) => (
            <div class="border-2 border-brutal-black dark:border-brutal-white p-5 hover:border-brutal-accent dark:hover:border-brutal-accent transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <div class="text-brutal-accent" set:html={topic.icon} />
                <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">{topic.label}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="border-2 border-brutal-black dark:border-brutal-white p-6">
          <h4 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">
            Learning by Doing
          </h4>
          <p class="text-brutal-black/70 dark:text-brutal-white/70 leading-relaxed">
            Not being afraid to show the messy parts. Real experiments, real failures,
            and real discoveries in the world of AI-assisted development.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
